"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5106790","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3784470-1846651706691400","game_id":"steam-3784470","kind":"announcement","title":"Watch Us Play Burakku Jakku Samurai: Tactical Roguelite Gameplay","summary":"Witness Lethal Calculation in Feudal Japan Welcome to the continuous gameplay showcase of Burakku Jakku Samurai during Steam Next Fest! Watch the blade in action as we demonstrate combat mechanics, resource management, and high-risk encounters in our pixel-art tactical roguelite. ⚔️ What You Are Watching Deep Tactical Combat: See how drawing, standing, and pushing for 21 directly impacts sword strikes and encounter survival. Ki Resource Manipulation: Discover advanced tactics to alter card value","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691400","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3784470-1846651706691343","game_id":"steam-3784470","kind":"announcement","title":"Play the Burakku Jakku Samurai Demo in Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Your Strategy is Your Blade. Your Life is on the Line. The gates of Steam Next Fest have opened, and the trial begins now. Step into feudal Japan as a lone ronin in the official demo of Burakku Jakku Samurai—a pixel-art tactical roguelite where every combat encounter is a ruthless, life-or-death puzzle. ⚔️ Chance Deals the Cards. Survival Demands Lethal Calculation. In this demo, luck is only the starting point. Victory belongs to those who bend the rules to their will: Lethal Blackjack Combat: ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691343","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3784470-1846651706684353","game_id":"steam-3784470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v1.1.1: Better Elite Rewards, Dynamic Audio & Fixes!","summary":"Greetings, Samurai! Thank you to everyone who has stepped onto the battlefield and tested the Burakku Jakku Samurai demo so far. Your feedback and playthroughs are the sharpening stone for our blade. Today we are rolling out Demo Patch v1.1.1, focused on making high-risk battles much more rewarding, improving tactical readability on the map, and making sure your opponents play by the rules! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45717372/c2964d59265632fde73b2ea48cee163b7833c61f.png ⚔️ Highlights of Patch v1.1.1 Spe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T11:21:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684353","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3784470-1845383656378702","game_id":"steam-3784470","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v1.1.0: Tactical Deck Rework, Campfire & Combat Polish","summary":"Demo Update v1.1.0: Tactical Deck Rework, Campfire Node & Combat Juice Sharpen your blade combat just got much more strategic. Based on player feedback and telemetry data from the demo, update v1.1.0 is now live. This patch significantly deepens tactical decision-making in combat, introduces a critical map recovery mechanic, and polishes combat feedback. 🃏 Tactical Deck Overhaul: Read the Odds The core card system has been completely re-architected to reward tactical planning: Single Standard De","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T19:00:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656378702","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3784470-1844115010489926","game_id":"steam-3784470","kind":"announcement","title":"devINITIVE Showcase 2026 is LIVE! Watch the Stream + Play the Demo","summary":"⚔️ devINITIVE Showcase 2026: Live Stream & Steam Event Tonight at 21:00 CEST, Burakku Jakku Samurai takes the stage at devINITIVE Showcase 2026 alongside an incredible lineup of indie games from across the Spanish-speaking development scene! We are also broadcasting automated gameplay here on our Steam page, so you can watch continuous runs and see how the deckbuilding combat unfolds in real-time. 🔴 Where to watch the Showcase & explore featured games:Explore all participating games on the devIN","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T18:50:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010489926","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3784470-1843481262697400","game_id":"steam-3784470","kind":"announcement","title":"Community Spotlight: First Full Playthrough & Early Feedback! ⚔️","summary":"Hello everyone! The Demo has been live for just over 24 hours, and the response has been incredible. Seeing players jump into the duels, test their Ki, and experiment with the mechanics is both thrilling and humbling for the team. Community HighlightA huge shoutout to creator theloladass Gaming (rafaaa) for diving deep into the demo and recording a nearly hour-long playthrough! Early Balance Insights: The Tea HouseWatching full, unedited runs gives us invaluable insight into combat flow, pacing,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T12:32:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262697400","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3784470-1843481262696008","game_id":"steam-3784470","kind":"announcement","title":"🎴 Burakku Jakku Samurai - PLAYABLE DEMO IS OUT NOW!","summary":"Travelers, the wait is over! The official demo of Burakku Jakku Samurai is available to download and play for free on Steam right now! Step into a tactical roguelite where calculating risk is the only way to survive. Combine classic Blackjack mechanics to build Ki, unleash lethal katana strikes, and master synergistic item builds against merciless foes. What's included in this demo:Full Act 1 tactical run: Dynamic path choices across Shrines, Gamblers, Elites, and Bosses. Core combat & deckbuild","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T17:31:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262696008","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3784470-1843481262692374","game_id":"steam-3784470","kind":"announcement","title":"Burakku Jakku Samurai Official Demo Launches September 11!","summary":"⚔️ The Blade Meets the Deck: Official Demo Drops September 11! Steel your resolve and prepare your hand. We are thrilled to announce that the official public demo for Burakku Jakku Samurai will be available for free on Steam starting September 11, 2026. What to Expect in the Demo We have crafted this demo to give you a complete, high-intensity vertical slice of the core loop: * Tactical Blackjack Combat: Experience the tension of 21 fused with precise, lethal 2D samurai duels. * Deckbuilding & S","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T14:14:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262692374","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3784470-1842846814454762","game_id":"steam-3784470","kind":"announcement","title":"Burakku Jakku Samurai Selected for Devinitive Show (Sept 16)!","summary":"⚔️ Burakku Jakku Samurai Selected for the Devinitive Show! ⚔️ Hello everyone! We have some exciting news to share: Burakku Jakku Samurai has been officially selected to feature in the upcoming Devinitive Show, taking place on September 16th. The showcase will highlight standout indie projects worldwide, giving us an incredible stage to present our tactical blend of deckbuilding, katana combat, and precision pixel art to players across the globe. 📅 What to Expect on September 16thFresh Gameplay F","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T06:03:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814454762","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3784470-1840944183776732","game_id":"steam-3784470","kind":"announcement","title":"PUBLIC PLAYTEST IS NOW LIVE! 🚨🗡️","summary":"Hello everyone! The moment has arrived: the Burakku Jakku Samurai Public Playtest is officially open to all players starting today up until 24th august. We’ve been working hard to bring this experience together, and now we need your help to test the core mechanics and gather critical feedback on gameplay, balance, and performance. ⚔️ How to Join the Playtest: Scroll down on our main Steam store page to the section that says \"Join the Burakku Jakku Samurai Playtest\". Click the \"Request Access\" bu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T13:13:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183776732","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3784470-1839041357027295","game_id":"steam-3784470","kind":"announcement","title":"Master the 21 Ki Limit: Burakku Jakku Samurai Live at EMA Week 2026!","summary":"Warriors, unsheathe your katanas. PixelScale is thrilled to announce that Burakku Jakku Samurai has been officially selected for Eastern Martial Arts Week 2026, presented by Spiral Up Games! From July 23 @ 10 AM PT to July 30 @ 10 AM PT, we will be broadcasting exclusive, uninterrupted developer gameplay directly on our Steam page. This is your chance to see our tactical pixel-art roguelite in action. We will be breaking down high-level strategies, showing firsthand how to manage the strict 21 K","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-23T17:00:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357027295","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3784470-1835871199306634","game_id":"steam-3784470","kind":"announcement","title":"Burakku Jakku Samurai: Stream & Samurai Challenge #10 Live!","summary":"Hey Samurais! While the Steam Next Fest is roaring all around us, we are carving our own path. Starting today, Friday at 12:00 PM, we are launching a massive, broadcast of Burakku Jakku Samurai! If you are looking for a unique tactical strategy experience where card mechanics meet precision sword combat, this is your place. Sit back, watch the gameplay loops, and analyze the deep Ki management and synergies we’ve built for you. ⚔️ The Road to Samurai Challenge #10 We want our community to be the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-19T10:00:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199306634","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3784470-1833334318580073","game_id":"steam-3784470","kind":"announcement","title":"Burakku Jakku Samurai Selected for GameEffect Showcase 2026!","summary":"Burakku Jakku Samurai Selected for the GameEffect Showcase!Hello everyone!We have some incredibly exciting news to share with you all today. BJS has been officially selected to participate in the upcoming GameEffect Showcase! 🎮✨It is an absolute honor for us to be a part of this digital event, which celebrates innovation, independent talent, and games that bring something truly unique to the table.We want to send a massive thank you to the GameEffect organization team for shortlisting our projec","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-26T18:10:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318580073","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3784470-1833334318577608","game_id":"steam-3784470","kind":"announcement","title":"Burakku Jakku Samurai - Live Dev Gameplay","summary":"Hey Samurais! 🃏⚔️ Welcome to our official livestream for the Steam Strategems event! We are jumping into the arena to show you a fresh look at Burakku Jakku Samurai. Join us we play the game: Guillem (Marketing Director) – Trying his best to survive the duels. Raimon (Production Director) – Explaining the design secrets and mechanics. Héctor (Pixel Artist) – Talking about the visual style and animations. We’ll be sharing development anecdotes, breaking down our tactical combat If you like what y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-25T16:45:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318577608","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3784470-1833334318574142","game_id":"steam-3784470","kind":"announcement","title":"Burakku Jakku Samurai Selected for Strategems Event This May 28!","summary":"The Battle of Wits and Cards Begins Soon!Greetings, Samurais!We have some incredibly exciting news to share with you all today. Burakku Jakku Samurai has been officially selected to participate in the upcoming Strategems event on Steam!From May 28th (10 AM PST) to June 4th, this festival celebrates the finest tactical and strategic minds on the platform, and we couldn't be prouder to showcase our blend of traditional Japanese lore, rogue-lite elements, and high-stakes blackjack mechanics and spe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-23T16:07:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318574142","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3784470-1829528821313506","game_id":"steam-3784470","kind":"announcement","title":"Inside the Tea House & a first look at our Cinematic Intro | Devlog#1","summary":"Hey everyone,We’ve been working hard on Burakku Jakku Samurai, and we’re finally ready to share some process with you. In this devlog, we wanted to take a break from the combat mechanics and show you the place where you'll be spending your downtime: The Tea House. Creating a SanctuaryFor us, the Tea House isn't just a generic shop where you click buttons to buy stuff. We’ve spent a lot of time researching the Sengoku period to make sure it feels like a real refuge. We focused on the concept of J","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-12T10:45:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821313506","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3784470-1828441623106855","game_id":"steam-3784470","kind":"announcement","title":"Blackjack + Samurais: 